e\">The Obsidian Vault</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thin-scroll min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-5 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"panel content scrollable area\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"status bar\">\n<span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[14px] text-white/85\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"status label\"><span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-[#9CC79A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"status dot\"></span>Đã nhận cọc</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"arrival note\">Chưa đến</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-y-2.5 border-b border-white/10 py-3 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"contact details block\">\n<a class=\"tnum flex items-center gap-3 text-white/90 hover:text-[#F8D127]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"phone contact link\" href=\"tel:0903118426\"><i class=\"ph ph-phone text-[17px] text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"phone icon\"></i>0903 118 426</a>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-white/75\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"email contact block\"><i class=\"ph ph-envelope-simple text-[17px] text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"envelope icon\"></i>dat.trinh@vietlink.com.vn</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-white/10 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"note block\">\n<div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#F8D127]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"note title with icon\"><i class=\"ph ph-note text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"note icon\"></i>Ghi chú của khách</div>\n<p class=\"border border-[#F8D127]/30 bg-[#F8D127]/[0.06] p-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-white/90\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"note body text\">Tiếp khách đối tác Nhật, 1 khách dị ứng gluten. Nhờ chuẩn bị thực đơn in tiếng Nhật.</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"grid grid-cols-[120px_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 py-4 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4\" data-name=\"detail metadata list\">\n<dt class=\"text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"date label\">Ngày</dt><dd class=\"tnum text-white/90\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"date value\">Chủ Nhật, 08/11/2026</dd>\n<dt class=\"text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"menu label\">Thực đơn</dt><dd class=\"text-white/90\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-4\" data-name=\"menu value with price\">14 Món Thượng Hạng (The Obsidian Vault)<div class=\"tnum text-[13px] text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"menu price\">3.450.000₫ / khách</div></dd>\n<dt class=\"text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-5\" data-name=\"taste label\">Khẩu vị</dt><dd class=\"text-white/90\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-6\" data-name=\"taste value\">Tiêu chuẩn Bếp trưởng (Cân bằng Wagyu &amp; Hải sản)</dd>\n<dt class=\"text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-7\" data-name=\"drinks label\">Thức uống</dt><dd class=\"text-white/90\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-8\" data-name=\"drinks value\">Wine Pairing 6 ly chọn lọc</dd>\n<dt class=\"text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-9\" data-name=\"deposit label\">Tiền cọc</dt><dd class=\"tnum text-white/90\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-10\" data-name=\"deposit value\">4.000.000₫<div class=\"text-[13px] text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-10-1\" data-name=\"deposit calculation\">500.000₫ × 8 khách</div></dd>\n<dt class=\"text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-11\" data-name=\"created label\">Tạo lúc</dt><dd class=\"tnum text-white/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-12\" data-name=\"created value\">03/11/2026 20:00</dd>\n<dt class=\"text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-13\" data-name=\"updated label\">Cập nhật</dt><dd class=\"tnum text-white/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-4-14\" data-name=\"updated value\">04/11/2026 09:15</dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-[64px] shrink-0 ite