\"1-2-2-2-2-1-3-3-3\" data-name=\"note detail label: taste preference\">Khẩu vị</dt><dd data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-3-3-4\" data-name=\"note detail value: taste preference\">Tiêu chuẩn Bếp trưởng</dd>\n<dt class=\"text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-3-3-5\" data-name=\"note detail label: beverages\">Thức uống</dt><dd data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-3-3-6\" data-name=\"note detail value: beverages\">Grand Cru Reserve 8 ly</dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<!-- Night context -->\n<div class=\"border-b border-white/10 px-5 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"date context and capacity section\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"date header and post-confirmation capacity\">\n<h3 class=\"text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"date context heading (Sat 21/11/2026)\">Thứ Bảy 21/11/2026</h3>\n<span class=\"tnum text-[13px] text-white/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"post-confirmation capacity summary\">Sau khi xác nhận: <b class=\"font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"post-confirmation guest count (this request)\">24</b>/24 khách</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex h-[10px] gap-[2px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"capacity visualization bar segments\">\n<span class=\"flex-[6] bg-white/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"capacity bar segment: already booked (6)\" title=\"Đã đặt: 6\"></span>\n<span class=\"flex-[18] bg-[#F8D127]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"capacity bar segment: this request (18)\" title=\"Yêu cầu này: 18\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tnum mt-2 flex gap-5 text-[12px] text-white/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-4-3\" data-name=\"capacity bar legend\">\n<span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"legend: already booked\"><span class=\"h-2 w-3 bg-white/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"legend swatch (booked)\"></span>Đã đặt 6</span>\n<span class